OL,3,GNEWSA'Oak nannies' come forward to
OL,4,Anurture seedlings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife trust said it had been
OL,7,Finundated with volunteers after a call
OL,8,Ffor "oak nannies" to nurture young
OL,9,Fseedlings at home.
OL,11,FSusan Antrobus, from the Tees Valley
OL,12,FWildlife Trust, said a woman in Great
OL,13,FBroughton got in touch after hundreds
OL,14,Fof oak saplings appeared under her
OL,15,Ftree.
OL,17,FHowever, upon collecting them, the
OL,18,Ftrust realised they were too small to
OL,19,Fbe planted on its nature reserves so
OL,20,Fcalled for people to look after the
OL,21,Fsaplings for a year until they were big
OL,22,Fenough.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
